snow_normal":0.0},"titles":{"year":"2026 so far: 8 daily record highs, no daily record lows","records":"Hilo has nearly stopped setting record lows","change":"Hilo has warmed, days and nights alike","rain":"Rain: no clear long-term change"},"text":{"lede":"Yesterday's high of 86\u00b0F was the 3rd warmest November 13 high of 78 since 1949, the warmest since 2019.","t_yest":"November 13: warmer than 97% of years","p_yest":"The high of <strong>86\u00b0F</strong> was the 3rd warmest November 13 high of 78 since 1949, the warmest since 2019. The normal high for the date is 82\u00b0F, and the record is 88\u00b0F (2019). The low of <strong>71\u00b0F</strong> was the 5th warmest November 13 low (tied) of 78 since 1949.","t_rec":"Hilo has nearly stopped setting record lows","p_rec":"If Hilo's climate weren't changing, every year would have the same chance of holding a daily record. Since 2000, Hilo has set <strong class=\"sig\">40 standing record lows</strong>, far fewer than the 127 that chance alone would give, and <strong>158 record highs</strong>, close to the 127 that chance alone would give. The 2010s hold the most record highs of any decade (88). Hilo's all-time high is 94\u00b0F, on May 20, 1966.","t_chg":"Hilo has warmed, days and nights alike","p_chg":"Across 75 complete years: Hilo's average low has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.32\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.24 to +0.41), about +2.4\u00b0F since 1950. Hilo's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.24\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.13 to +0.36), about +1.8\u00b0F since 1950.","t_mon":"Lows rose in all 12 months. Highs rose in 11 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Hilo's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (\u22122.90 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 120.5 inches a year. The wettest year was 1990 (211.22 in); the driest, 2025 (58.74 in). Hilo almost never sees snow (the 1991\u20132020 average is 0.0 inches a winter), so there's no snowfall chart.","show_snow":false,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 8 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}